nty runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, August to September came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years, more than any other pair of months. In 2025 that same pair came in at 44% of normal on the middle, and January to February was 36%. Grid 25052 had its driest year in 1988 at 58% of normal.</p>"}
